      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "`geoserver_publish` accepts `kind: raster` for `.tif`/`.tiff` and `kind: vector` for a `.zip` containing one same-named SHP dataset. `workspace` is optional when `defaultWorkspace` is configured; an explicit request value overrides the default. Existing layers are rejected rather than replaced. Optional flat `metadata` fields such as `projectId` and `datasetId` are returned by the tool and forwarded to the webhook."
